description	"Darth Wyyrlok III

The Lorekeeper and premier Sith Sorcerer. Focuses on psychological warfare, and a barrage of force powers.

^2Weaponry:
- Lightsaber (Purple)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Defense (0)
-- Blaster Deflect (0)
-- Low Damage Saber (120)
-- Knocks Back and Force Focuses On Hit

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (1)
- Push (2)
- Force Protect (1)
- Mind Trick (3)
- Drain (3) ^3[CS2]
- Repulse ^3[CS1]
- Lightning (3) ^3[CS3]
-- Ignites On Hit
- Sith Ruin (Destruction 2) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Force Focus (2)
- Water Breathing
- Healing Capped At 35
- Force Block (1)
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)"